ALAC decoder
  src/airplay_alac.cpp follows the Apple Lossless Audio Codec reference decoder,
  Copyright (c) 2011 Apple Inc., published under the Apache License 2.0
  (https://github.com/macosforge/alac).

AirPort Express key
  src/airplay_key.cpp contains the RSA private key of the AirPort Express. It was extracted
  and published in 2011 and is used by every open source AirPlay 1 receiver; senders use it
  to authenticate receivers and to encrypt the session key.

Protocol references
  shairport-sync (https://github.com/mikebrady/shairport-sync), in particular the timing of
  sync packets and the latency offset of current senders.
  airplay-esp32 (https://github.com/rbouteiller/airplay-esp32), in particular the position
  servo that trims single frames.

